  "hotelDescription": "Get to great local sights quicker than you can say \u0027abracadabra\u0027 with Premier Inn Hotel Watford North. In a great spot just outside Watford\u0027s vibrant town centre, you\u0027ll be well placed for attractions like Warner Brothers Studios, as well as business and leisure destinations in central London. \n\nPlan a magical family adventure to Warner Brothers Studios for the Harry Potter tour. Hunt for the latest looks at Intu Watford shopping centre. Or discover the historic heart of nearby St Albans. Then unwind with a tasty meal in our restaurant, and relax in your spacious room and huge, comfy bed.",
